# Architecture is DDD

Read `.cursor/skills/ddd-architecture/SKILL.md` before adding modules, tables, or APIs.

- Modular monolith. One process. Eight bounded contexts. No microservices.
- One aggregate instance per transaction. Other aggregates by id. Cross-context via events.
- Domain layer has no FastAPI, Pydantic, SQLAlchemy, or HTTP imports.
- Transport DTOs and SQLAlchemy rows are not the domain model.
- Business rules live on the aggregate, not only in validators or controllers.
